&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive, you’ll own a curated book of named enterprise accounts across key EMEA markets and be the primary driver of net-new revenue and platform expansion. You’ll bring Vercel’s platform into some of the region’s most digitally ambitious companies, working alongside Solutions Engineers, a Partner Manager, and cross-functional teams at Vercel. This is a hybrid role with 3 in-office days per week in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute multi-year account plans across named enterprise accounts, with hyperscalers, systems integrators, and agency partners involved from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive net-new revenue through outbound prospecting, rigorous discovery, executive alignment, and multi-threaded deals across engineering, product, procurement, legal, and the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Vercel’s platform into board-level business cases built on developer velocity, infrastructure consolidation, and AI-driven transformation, with measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex commercial negotiations and position Vercel as a long-term strategic infrastructure partner in your accounts’ web and AI roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you need&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years selling enterprise SaaS, including closing six- and seven-figure deals in major or strategic accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activated hyperscaler, systems integrator, or independent software vendor (ISV) partners in co-sell motions to open accounts and accelerate deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led technical discovery with CTOs and senior engineering and product leaders, and total cost of ownership discussions with CFOs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built multi-year account plans for named accounts and developed executive relationships from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast deals using MEDDPICC and kept CRM data current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Bonus if you&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in web development, developer tooling, web infrastructure, cloud platforms, or AI/ML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold existing relationships at AWS, GCP, Azure, or systems integrators and ISVs active in the UK and Northern Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have negotiated enterprise license agreements (ELAs), global framework agreements, or enterprise procurement in regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Compensation:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
